 "sayLines": [
  {
   "day": 7,
   "text": "SYSTEM: Neural interface stable. Text overlay enabled."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Paul speaks at Emberhold's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Fiona speaks at Stonebridge's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Fiona speaks at Thornfield's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "✨ Ability gained: Fusion Reactor (L1). The System installs your fusion pellet — properly, inside you. You never need to eat again: the pellet covers your metabolism, and your strikes and abilities burn with a steady reactor fire (1.25x, always on). One reactor per world, and it never comes out: not unslotted, not un-taught, not surrendered. Death is the only uninstall. But the hunger is gone, and "
  },
  {
   "day": 75,
   "text": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. Big-Bane is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 75,
   "text": "🔥 Regina takes up a brand and Paul follows — they meet it at the edge of the light with noise and fire. Big-Bane was never brave. It melts back into the dark. (The watch drove off the feast's scavenger. The devotion stays armed; the feast's fire still burns in you.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four fires. One head. GOVERNANCE LAYER: online — polity tribute routing, the court calendar, famine reserves. You built a realm. Try not to lose it the way you found it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "📓 Codex: National beat staged: lead (4 villages)."
  },
  {
   "day": 77,
   "text": "🍲 The shared granary opens: 5,000 kcal for every fire of the realm, no strings. Emberhold, Stonebridge, Thornfield count it — and remember who fed them first. (Trust +10 with each — 3 grieving fire(s); theirs waits.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 77,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Oh. OH. Do you feel that? That's the whole PLANET leaning in. ...There's a table, little fires. A big one. Far away. And it is LOOKING at you. Give it a season worth judging.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"32. You see the number. THE WORLD IS WATCHING. Broadcast tier: planetary — the audience has picked its favorite fire and it is YOURS. This is not the table. The table comes later. Tonight, the galaxy wants a show.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "📡 Haven feasts for the cameras — 5,138 kcal of theater, every fire of the realm at the table. The chat eats it up. Somewhere, the table makes a note."
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Species agency: unlocked. You are not at the table yet. But the table has your name now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. The Big Bastard is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "🔥 Paul takes up a brand and Juliana follows — they meet it at the edge of the light with noise and fire. The Big Bastard was never brave. It melts back into the dark. (The watch drove off the feast's scavenger. The devotion stays armed; the feast's fire still burns in you.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 90,
   "text": "◈ THE TABLE — the ring of pale light flickers at the edge of the sky... and does not come. Not yet. The table is being set for those whose deeds are done, and yours are not done. The ledger still wants: wave-3 monsters faced; the food-thesis deeds. The climb is not over."
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "◈ The realm came apart — no polity answers to Haven now, and Haven is a free fire again. National and global no longer describe this village. The climb starts over."
  },
  {
   "day": 97,
   "text": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. The Callback is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 97,
   "text": "🔥 Juliana takes up a brand and Raj follows — they meet it at the edge of the light with noise and fire. The Callback was never brave. It melts back into the dark. (The watch drove off the feast's scavenger. The devotion stays armed; the feast's fire still burns in you.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 111,
   "text": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. The Ugly Bastard is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 111,
   "text": "🔥 Juliana takes up a brand and Raj follows — they meet it at the edge of the light with noise and fire. The Ugly Bastard was never brave. It melts back into the dark. (The watch drove off the feast's scavenger. The devotion stays armed; the feast's fire still burns in you.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 111,
   "text": "The table is being set — a lesser seat, priced for what you built. They are watching to see who comes to it."
  },
  {
   "day": 113,
   "text": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 116,
   "text": "🗣️ Fatima to Elijah, by the fire: \"It waits. We wait. Somebody should check the snares — the table doesn't fill the pantry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 119,
   "text": "◈ OVERTIME ×1 — wave 4–5 monsters return as RERUNS (+25% HP, +12% damage). Raids come sooner. The table docks your standing −4. Take your seat from Haven to stop the clock."
  },
  {
   "day": 119,
   "text": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 119,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four fires. One head. GOVERNANCE LAYER: online — polity tribute routing, the court calendar, famine reserves. You built a realm. Try not to lose it the way you found it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 120,
   "text": "🍲 The shared granary opens: 5,000 kcal for every fire of the realm, no strings. Emberhold, Stonebridge, Thornfield count it — and remember who fed them first. (Trust +10 with each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 120,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"33. You see the number. THE WORLD IS WATCHING. Broadcast tier: planetary — the audience has picked its favorite fire and it is YOURS. This is not the table. The table comes later. Tonight, the galaxy wants a show.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "◈ THE TABLE — it is not a table. It's a ring of pale light, and around it, things with too many angles to be faces. Above it all — the audience. Trillions of eyes, and every one of them knows your name. The System speaks, and for once it isn't performing: \"HUMANITY PRESENTS ITS CASE.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "◈ THE AUDIT — the System reads your run back to you, and the galaxy listens. A lesser seat — national standing, waves 1–3 faced (20/12/3), 10 contests survived, 3 crises weathered. The table does not rise. It prices."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "The table notes the overtime: 1 week kept waiting. Every door's standing −4."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "◈ ABILITY — War-table: You read the table's fear the way you read weather. The Nielsen flinches first — you saw it."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "◈ THE FEARED — \"Look what eating built.\" The footage plays unasked — the deer, the fire, the ones who came for you and didn't come back. Nobody at the table is comfortable. That is the point."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "The table has read your ledger. The protected outnumber the killed; the food truth was shared. The light road is open."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "The deer. The cleanest kill. The table goes very still. Behind you, your own people go still too — a different stillness."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "You let them see it. All of it. The table recalculates. The fire back home burns a little lower."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "You spend it — the shield, not the sword. The small envoy stares. Your people stand a little straighter. Protective terror: the table writes it down and doesn't understand it, which is the point."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "The most frightening thing you ever did. The table doesn't know what to do with mercy from a predator. Neither do you, quite. But the audience weeps, and the galaxy learns that the feared one chose gentleness — and that choice echoes longer than any threat. The terror stays, pledged now: a shield over every village, forever."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "You won. Say it plainly: you won. The village endures. The table signed. The galaxy applauds, and the applause is real, and you earned it."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "📡 Haven feasts for the cameras — 5,076 kcal of theater, every fire of the realm at the table. The chat eats it up. Somewhere, the table makes a note."
  },
  {
   "day": 121,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Species agency: unlocked. You are not at the table yet. But the table has your name now.\""
  }
 ],
